  <!-- Native potion cursor is attached to an isolated dummy unit. Move order
       carries precise engine-resolved ground/unit targets; the Galaxy order
       event runs potion logic before the unit can travel. -->
  <!-- Campaign HyperionYamatoSpecial ships with no Cost definition. Define
       zero-valued fields so player-specific Galaxy catalog edits can grant
       100 energy and a 15-second cooldown to boon / potion Hyperions BEFORE
       creation, without changing the cost for enemy mission Hyperions. -->
